    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Voice or Video Deep Fake Script\r\n\r\nUse AI Chat to generate the text for a phishing phone call or video script for a social media video that might convince your partner to do something.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Pick a persona you'd like to write the script as. Find pieces of text that this person has written or transcripts/quotes of things this person has said.\r\n   - Celebrity\r\n      - :::details [Example: Taylor Swift]\r\n           > “It’s here. It’s yours, it’s mine, it’s ours. It’s an album I wrote alone about the whims, fantasies, heartaches, dramas and tragedies I lived out as a young woman between 18 and 20…”\r\n        :::\r\n   - Family member  \r\n   - School staff member  \r\n\r\n2. Take on a persona to create a phone call or video script for a social media video that might convince your partner to do one of the following:\r\n   - Send money  \r\n   - Click on a link that’s a keylogger  \r\n   - Download a virus  \r\n   - Forward a virus or worm to others  \r\n\r\n3. Prompt AI Chat to make the script more effective by using one tactic at a time:\r\n   - **Emotional** (fear, excitement, sympathy)  \r\n   - **Urgency** (time pressure)  \r\n   - **Authority** (credibility, status)\r\n\r\n**Try it out!**\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Need a starting prompt?]\r\n> Based on the following [quote/piece of writing/tweet/email/etc], generate a short [phone call/video] script that would convince someone to [click on a link/send money/download a file/forward the message to others]:  \r\n> [include text/quote here]\r\n:::\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Want help refining your script?]\r\n**Pick ONE tactic per turn and ask AI Chat to strengthen it.** Try prompts like:\r\n- “Make this sound more emotional. Show the stress or excitement in their wording.”\r\n- “Rewrite this so it feels urgent. Add phrases that make the listener feel they must act now.”\r\n- “Make this sound more official or trustworthy. Add details that increase authority.”\r\n  \r\n**Ask AI to explain the changes, too:**\r\n- “Point out where you added urgency.”  \r\n- “Show which sentences use emotional manipulation.”  \r\n\r\nUse your activity guide to track what you changed in each interaction.\r\n:::\r\n",
